# Haiku-PyAPI bindtests configuration.
# Copy to `.env` (next to this file, or point BINDTESTS_ENV at it).
# Real environment variables ALWAYS override .env values (dotenv standard).
# All keys are optional — the defaults match the standard installed-VM
# layout (see the "Configuration" section of README.md).

# the Be package dir the tests import (the symlink .so farm)
#BE_PKG_DIR=/boot/home/prefixrun/Be

# bindings source tree used by selectmods for the static dep analysis
# (host dev copy also works: PYAPI_BINDINGS=~/src/haiku-pyapi-dev/bindings)
#PYAPI_BINDINGS=/boot/home/Haiku-PyAPI/bindings

# the stock __init__.py defining the canonical import order
#PYAPI_STOCK_INIT=/boot/home/Haiku-PyAPI/bindings/__init__.py

# guest-side TSS budget checker, used by: selectmods.py --budget
#PYAPI_BUDGET=/boot/home/budget.py

# fallback dir for selectmods.py when it is not copied alongside the suite
#PYAPI_SELECTMODS_DIR=/boot/home

# scratch dir for test-created files (default: <suite dir>/scratch)
#BINDTESTS_SCRATCH=/tmp/bindtests_scratch

# where to look for .env if not next to the suite
#BINDTESTS_ENV=
